    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "27 Maple Drive is a recently decorated semi-detached 4 bedroom family home, situated in a mature and quiet estate within walking distance of Kells town.\n\nThe accommodation includes an entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, shower room and a versatile additional room, formerly the garage, which could be used as a home office/study, playroom or additional downstairs bedroom. Upstairs, there are four bedrooms and a family bathroom. Floor space c. 130.15 sq.m.\n\nOutside, there is a large lawned rear garden with a patio area, while the front provides a tarmac driveway for off-street parking.\n\nThis property offers an excellent opportunity to live in an established estate, with the convenience of being within walking distance of Kells town and its amenities.\n\nLOCATION\nThe property is located near Kells town centre and within easy access to the M3/M50.\nKells is one of Ireland`s most historic and vibrant heritage towns, offering an exceptional quality of life and an excellent range of amenities, including a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools. The town boasts an excellent choice of sporting facilities, including the renowned Headfort Golf Club, a swimming pool, GAA, soccer and rugby clubs, together with a wide variety of shops, cafs, award-winning restaurants, traditional pubs and hotels.\n\nKells is also home to a thriving community and a rich cultural calendar, hosting events such as the acclaimed Hinterland Festival of Literature Arts and the Samhain Festival of Food Culture, both of which attract visitors from across the country.\n\nEntrance Hallway\nWelcoming hallway with wooden flooring and red deal wooden staircase.\n\nLiving Room\nTo the front, featuring an open fire with a tiled surround and solid oak flooring.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room\nSpacious open-plan kitchen/dining room with a fitted kitchen and ample space for a family dining table. A large window and sliding patio doors overlook the mature rear garden and fill the room with light. Laminate flooring.\n\nUtility Room\nUseful utility room with door access to the rear garden. Fully plumbed with sink, shelving and storage unit, along with the boiler.\n\nShower Room\nW.C., w.h.b. and electric shower. Tiled flooring and partially tiled walls.\n\nRoom\nVersatile room, formerly the garage, which could be used as a home office/study, playroom or additional downstairs bedroom.\n\nBedroom 1\nTo the front. Fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2\nTo the front. Single room.\n\nBedroom 3\nTo the rear. Double room.\n\nBedroom 3\nTo the rear. Double room.\n\nBedroom 4\nTo rear. Single room.\n\nBathroom\nFully tiled, with w.c., w.h.b., bath and electric shower.\n\nOutside\nTo the front, a tarmac driveway provides parking for two cars. To the rear, there is a large lawned garden with patio area, mature planting and garden shed, with side access.\n\n\nDirections\nFrom Kells, drive out Farrell Street (R164) for 1.2km and turn left onto Maple Drive. Property is on the left hand side. See sign. Eircode: A82 D8C0.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
